ealized that this was not the case. I got addicted to them. However, I soon got bored with them anyway. And then I recently stumbled upon a site with <a href=\"https://canadamongolia.ca/\" target=\"_blank\">casino reviews</a>. Well, it was an amazing find for me. Now the game world has opened up for me in a whole new way and play with new colors.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":27659,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27659-cybergirl","user":"Cybergirl","date":". 12-06-2022, 12:32 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27659-cybergirl","name":"Cybergirl","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27659_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-11-14T04:33:09-08:00","id":1497087,"title":"","content":"DNA Inc. for Werewolf the Apocalypse.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Amethyst is my birthstone. She/they.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26996-amethyst","name":"Amethyst","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26996_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"873"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-11-14T18:01:11-08:00","id":1497142,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Cybergirl</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/1479108-companies-invented-for-your-games?p=1497081#post1497081\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">That's an odd question. I don't know how to answer it.</div> </div> </div> </div>I will give an example of my most recent one. Life Affirming Ethical Defenses (LEAD) is an It-X company that makes non-lethal weapons, force-field generating body-gear and countermeasures military technology that impairs the weapon-related functions of aircraft. They even make sound-guns for managing wildlife. Players in my Mage Chronicle have to investigate this company.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Thank you for passing time with me in conversation. <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1480242-horizon-s-wild-and-crazy-homebrew-rules-and-metaplot-choices\" target=\"_blank\">My Hacks</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26467-horizonparty2021","name":"HorizonParty2021","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26467_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"610"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-12-03T09:29:05-08:00","id":1498682,"title":"","content":"A new one that has popped up in our VTM game is The Ellis Detective Agency that is quietly run by a Nosferatu &amp; Malkavian ancilla. They use it as a means to gather info recent Kindred arrivals and occult lore on the side.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Power that needs to advertise itself is already losing&quot; Grand Admiral Thrawn <br /> <br /> &quot;Coronation Starscream? This is bad comedy!&quot; Galvatron","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27361-lysander","name":"Lysander","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27361_11.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3523"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-12-07T19:02:19-08:00","id":1499107,"title":"","content":"ACES Corporation: Alpha Communications &amp; Energy Syndicate: It's a collection of corporations that manufacture communications-devices, consumer-products, advanced military-vehicles and oil-products. I don't remember the details on who runs it, but they were all, American good ole'boys. looking to get richer and push their political-ideology in an Alternate-2000's. They had zero supernatural influence as they were written for a Cyberpunk-game. <br /> <br /> First, in the '90's, they got themselves in a war with an Arab-dictator and then, they got themselves in a war for Antarctican oil with another corporation and they created a lot of machines ala Philip K. Dicks <i>Second Variety</i> short story (The movie, <i>Screamers</i>).","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;I have all the power in the world to give you, and all you have to do is beg&quot; -Nix<br /> <br /> &quot;There's thing about being a vampire, Frank; it takes a long fucking time to learn how do all the cool shit&quot;. -Abigail","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2521-iguazu","name":"Iguazu","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2521_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"740"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-12-08T02:47:26-08:00","id":1499133,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Ragged Robin</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/1479108-companies-invented-for-your-games?p=1485408#post1485408\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">-It hasn't got really got a name except &quot;something unpronounceable in eastern european&quot; but they sell really shitty cars and the symbol is a horsefly. Effectively it shows up in wod if you need a car and either have 1 resource or only roll one success.on aquire car. Its a simpsons ref.</div> </div> </div> </div>\u200b<br /> <br /> Like <a href=\"https://www.gizmodo.com.au/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2020/01/21/pyajzgvjvmped8dh0vre.png\" target=\"_blank\">this</a> one, you mean? Technically not unpronounceable at all - and since looking into most slavic languages generally gives something like muska anyway, one might go instead with <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Horse-fly\" target=\"_blank\">Tabanidae</a>, from good old latin for science, i guess.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1147,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1147-baaldam","user":"Baaldam","date":". 12-08-2022, 06:15 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1147-baaldam","name":"Baaldam","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1147_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4937"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-12-12T23:34:24-08:00","id":1499502,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Baaldam</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/1479108-companies-invented-for-your-games?p=1499133#post1499133\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">\u200b<br /> <br /> Like <a href=\"http://&quot;https://www.gizmodo.com.au/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2020/01/21/pyajzgvjvmped8dh0vre.png&quot;\" target=\"_blank\">this</a> one, you mean? Technically not unpronounceable at all - and since looking into most slavic languages generally gives something like muska anyway, one might go instead with <a href=\"http://&quot;https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Horse-fly&quot;\" target=\"_blank\">Tabanidae</a>, from good old latin for science, i guess.</div> </div> </div> </div>Sort of, part of the joke is that westerners cannot pronounce the name (except the hermetic for obvious reasons) I think if I run an game in eastern europe I might have a western brand with some other loser animal and use a really awkward English word as the name.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":26986,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26986-ragged-robin","user":"Ragged Robin","date":". 12-13-2022, 02:37 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26986-ragged-robin","name":"Ragged Robin","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26986_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1720"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-12-13T15:24:26-08:00","id":1499581,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Ragged Robin</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/1479108-companies-invented-for-your-games?p=1499502#post1499502\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon_